{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17108180","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17108180","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1710818001:0":{"text":"諦めろ、エイドリアン。これ以上は、己を辱めるだけだ。","source_cn":"住手吧，奥利安。不要再羞辱自己了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DBB093683E6A2DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710818002:0":{"text":"その芝居も、そろそろ終わりにしよう。","source_cn":"你的表演，该结束了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E336846F50639E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710818003:0":{"text":"そ、そんな、ありえない……あ、あなたは……","source_cn":"不、不可能……你……你是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C99A96ECF42F1F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710818004:0":{"text":"私が誰だか分からないのか？名ばかりの末裔よ。","source_cn":"不认识我吗？我名义上的后代子嗣。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9D8A77D49BEA584","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710818005:0":{"text":"ろ、ローランド様……","source_cn":"罗、罗兰……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD59865618E9F817","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710818006:1":{"text":"ブライトの民よ！","source_cn":"耀光的子民们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD24115ED66B5C539","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710818007:1":{"text":"二千年前、私はデューラ様とともに、この地に希望を残した。","source_cn":"两千年前，我与艾雅女神并肩，将希望留给了这片土地。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2AAC319F0B09521","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710818008:1":{"text":"この剣は、最も屈強な戦士を選ぶためでもなければ、最も狡猾な策士を選ぶためのものでもない。","source_cn":"我们一同留下了这把石中剑，不是为了选出一个最强壮的战士...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68E42F6B9BFFD7C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710818009:1":{"text":"カリバーンが選ぶのは、心から民を思い、国のためなら犠牲をも厭わず、ブライトを光の道へ導く――","source_cn":"而是为了选出一个——真正能为民着想、真正愿为国牺牲、真...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF32F73A9FB18345","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710818010:1":{"text":"真の国王だ！","source_cn":"国王！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0221C0611A920D63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1710818011:1":{"text":"我々に必要なのは勇気と公正、そして永遠に揺るがぬ、民への責任だ！","source_cn":"我们需要的，是勇气，是公正，是国王心中不灭的……对人民...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B068F76AA39E681","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1710818012:1":{"text":"だが君は違う、エイドリアン。君は宮廷魔術師と結託し、古聖堂の消失を偽装して、嘘と偽りで栄光を掠め取ろうとした。","source_cn":"而不是像你一样，奥利安——联合宫廷魔法师，制造了圣古堂...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0952943952A66967","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1710818013:1":{"text":"わ、私は……黙れ！私は選ばれたんだ！","source_cn":"我、我……住口！我、我是被选中的人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA9176833A65E0E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1710818014:0":{"text":"いや、君ではない。君では、カリバーンは抜けない……","source_cn":"不，你不是，你也拔不出石中剑……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74C08E16ABB6A580","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1710818015:0":{"text":"なぜなら、カリバーンは君の魂を見抜いている。虚言で塗り固めた偽りの勇気など、通用しない。","source_cn":"因为石中剑能看穿你的灵魂！它能看穿你那用谎言堆砌出的虚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4ABF3762FF9112ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1710818016:0":{"text":"君はこの剣に、相応しくない。","source_cn":"你——德不配位！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAA78DD59D57D498","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1710818017:0":{"text":"違う……私は、違う！……こんなはずじゃ……！","source_cn":"不……我……没有……这不是真的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA77EE99A21D9A913","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1710818018:1":{"text":"お兄様……","source_cn":"……哥哥……<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64AC36BC6AAFAD9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1710818019:1":{"text":"い、一体どういうことですか殿下！？","source_cn":"这、这到底是怎么回事？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x632983A3BEBD4AC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1710818020:1":{"text":"殿下が……古聖堂を消した？","source_cn":"圣古堂消失……是王子做的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2961B9DB29EC72F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1710818021:1":{"text":"エイドリアン様は……剣を抜けなかった……","source_cn":"他……他拔不出剑……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x916EDEE270E10BDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1710818022:1":{"text":"ざ、戯言を！","source_cn":"你……你凭什么这么说？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB0B59AA84E2F453","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1710818023:1":{"text":"ローランド大帝は二千年も前に姿を消したのだ！誰がお前の話など信じるか！","source_cn":"罗兰大帝已经消失两千年了！你以为你能随意冒充他吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9228DF2F1190EFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1710818024:1":{"text":"どうせ、どこぞのメイジが仕組んだ茶番だろう！お前が本物のローランド大帝だと証明できるのか！？","source_cn":"这一定是某个魔法师耍的把戏！你怎么证明你是真的罗兰大帝？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D3CD3B627B842DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1710818025:0":{"text":"ふむ、君の言うとおりだ。王たる者にとって、言葉ほど無力な弁明はない。","source_cn":"啊，你说的没错。对于王者而言，言语是最无力的辩解。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA9F8062DA741A04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1710818026:0":{"text":"証明する方法は、目の前にあるではないか。","source_cn":"验证方法，不就摆在这里吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04E3958BB7489318","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:罗兰大帝":{"text":"ローランド大帝","source":"罗兰大帝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奥利安":{"text":"エイドリアン","source":"奥利安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speake